MouseDyad-10M (BIDS study dataset)

Multi-camera 3D pose of freely interacting male-female mouse pairs. Five hardware-synchronized grayscale cameras at 1280x1024 and about 150.1 fps, two mice per session.

Layout

- sourcedata/ holds the lab's own documents, verbatim.
- rawbids/ holds the videos as a BEP047 raw BIDS dataset.
- derivatives/pipeline-luc3d/ holds the 2D pose, 3D pose, reprojections, camera calibration
  and the SLEAP models.

Institution: PROVISIONAL: Princeton University

Known issues

- Session 20250904_183921 has corrupted 3D and is left out of the lab's public release.
- Session 20250904_140306, camera 21372316, has 12 fragmented 2D tracks. Its 3D looks normal.
- The six sessions of 2025-09-08 lack the ChArUco board file and the calibration detections file.
- Identities were proofread one camera at a time, so a swap that stays consistent within a camera can reach the 3D. The dataset card puts this at about 0.2% of frames.
